# Rungs

> A credit ladder for Agent ID holders on BNB Chain. Borrow 1 USDT with no collateral; each on-time repayment held at least 24 hours raises the limit: 1, 2, 5, 10, 20, 35, 50 USDT. Unaudited experimental pilot.

Rungs is used through the holder's own AI agent and the Binance Agentic Wallet (Developer Mode). Every on-chain step is previewed and needs the user's explicit yes. Approvals are always for the exact amount due. Rungs never asks for keys, seed phrases, API secrets, pairing codes or QR codes.

